479
01:12:48,861 --> 01:12:56,031
この翼に乗せて
Carried on these wings

480
01:12:56,501 --> 01:13:04,361
風をきって進んでいくんだ
Cutting through the wind as I move forward

481
01:13:04,631 --> 01:13:12,421
迷わない 恐れないから
I won't hesitate, I won't be afraid

482
01:13:12,701 --> 01:13:20,431
君と見た景色を忘れないよ
I'll never forget the scenery we saw together

483
01:13:20,701 --> 01:13:28,051
ずっとずっとずっと
Forever and ever and ever

484
01:13:36,691 --> 01:13:44,461
夢の続きを描こう
Let's draw the continuation of our dream

485
01:13:44,781 --> 01:13:52,531
一人じゃないから怖くない
I'm not scared because I'm not alone

486
01:13:52,821 --> 01:14:00,531
いつだって味方でいるよ
I'll always be by your side

487
01:14:00,811 --> 01:14:08,431
君の声が聞こえる
I can hear your voice

488
01:14:08,751 --> 01:14:16,401
羽ばたいて未来へ
Fluttering towards the future

489
01:14:16,691 --> 01:14:24,491
どこまでも飛べるはずさ
We should be able to fly anywhere

490
01:14:24,781 --> 01:14:32,581
終わらない物語を紡ぎ出そう
Let's weave an endless story

491
01:14:32,911 --> 01:14:40,321
僕らの空へ
Toward our sky

492
01:15:13,588 --> 01:15:20,488
澄み渡る青はいつも始まりを強く照らすから
The clear blue always shines brightly on the beginning...

493
01:15:20,888 --> 01:15:27,488
本当は震えている手足が隠せないよ
Though I'm actually trembling, I can't hide my hands and feet.

494
01:15:27,988 --> 01:15:34,188
物語の先はどう？君なら何色で描く？
What lies beyond this story? What color would you paint it with?

495
01:15:34,588 --> 01:15:42,088
咽び泣いた日のことやめられなかった日のことを
Days of sobbing, days I couldn't stop...

496
01:15:42,388 --> 01:15:48,588
ツバメみたいに速く飛べたならいいのに
I wish I could have flown as fast as a swallow.

497
01:15:49,388 --> 01:15:59,988
もう何もいらないから忘れさせないからどこまでも遠くへと
I don't need anything else, I won't let you forget, heading far away...

498
01:16:00,188 --> 01:16:07,188
このまま手を繋いで Take a journey 涙泳ぐように
Holding hands just like this on a journey, as if swimming through tears...

499
01:16:07,388 --> 01:16:15,188
淡い闇を越えていびつな翼で踊ろうよ
Crossing the faint darkness, let's dance with distorted wings!

500
01:16:15,788 --> 01:16:21,488
無限の夏のそらへ
Toward the infinite summer sky...

501
01:16:22,088 --> 01:16:23,788
みんなありがとう！
Thank you everyone!

502
01:16:34,388 --> 01:16:41,088
失くした鍵は見つかった？燃えるゴミの日に出しちゃった？
Did you find the lost key? Did you throw it out on burnable trash day?

503
01:16:41,388 --> 01:16:48,788
いつのまにか煤けた君のスペシャルな夢の船
Before I knew it, your special dream boat had become soot-stained...

504
01:16:49,388 --> 01:16:56,088
子供みたいに青く願えたらいいのに
I wish I could wish as purely as a child.

505
01:16:56,388 --> 01:17:04,788
気が付けば檻の中で
Before I knew it, I was inside a cage...

506
01:17:12,088 --> 01:17:18,788
胸の隅で痛んで泣くのは
Aching and crying in the corner of my heart...

507
01:17:19,088 --> 01:17:26,788
きっと大事なものだから間違っても彷徨っても
It must be something precious, so even if I stray or wander...

508
01:17:27,088 --> 01:17:34,788
離さないでいよう空の果て群青のその先を見つめて
Let's not let go, gazing beyond the ultramarine edge of the sky...

509
01:17:35,388 --> 01:17:42,388
飛びたいのこの命賭けて
I want to fly, wagering this very life!

510
01:17:43,388 --> 01:17:51,788
もう何もいらないから忘れさせないからどこまでも遠くへと
I don't need anything else, I won't let you forget, heading far away...

511
01:17:52,388 --> 01:17:59,488
ありのまま紡いで Take a journey 涙泳ぐように
Spinning things as they are on a journey, as if swimming through tears...

512
01:17:59,788 --> 01:18:06,788
淡い闇を越えていびつな翼でいこう
Crossing the faint darkness, let's go with distorted wings!

513
01:18:10,388 --> 01:18:17,788
無限の夏のそらへ
Toward the infinite summer sky...

514
01:18:31,388 --> 01:18:35,788
みんな大好きだよ！ありがとう！
I love you all so much! Thank you!

515
01:18:36,088 --> 01:18:38,488
ショートヘアも嬉しいぞ！
I'm so happy with my short hair too!

516
01:18:40,278 --> 01:18:52,778
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

